# Optional public defaults for the Vite frontend.
# Copy to `.env` (git-ignored). These values are compiled into the browser
# bundle, so use ONLY public values:
#
#   ✅ Supabase Project URL
#   ✅ Supabase anon / publishable key
#   ❌ Gemini API key
#   ❌ Supabase service-role / secret key
#   ❌ OpenAI key
#
# Users can override the Supabase values in Settings → Cloud & Database at
# runtime; these are only convenience defaults for a self-hosted deployment.

# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOi...
